  "body": "### What is the issue with the Fetch Standard?\r\n\r\nAs per https://whatwg.org/working-mode#anchors could we please make the following anchors permanent?\r\n\r\n- https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-destination\r\n- https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cors-check\r\n\r\nThese are used by the [compression dictionary](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-compression-dictionary/) IETF spec.",
